==Company Information==
*'''Name:''' Ponos Corporation, Limited
*'''CEO:''' Tsujiko Yorikatsu
*'''Headquarters:'''
*Japan.
*Yubinbango 600-8005.
*Nittochi Kyoto Shijo-dori Building, 12-1 Tachiuri Higashi-cho, Shimogyo-ku, Kyoto-shi, Kyoto
*'''Founded:''' 1990.
*'''Website:''' http://www.ponos.jp
*'''Business content:''' "''We believe that the development of games for smart devices is the core of our growth strategy in the game business, and we are distributing original games planned and developed by ourselves not only in Japan but also in overseas markets through the App Store, Google Play, and other markets. In the future, we will further expand our game lineup and distribution countries to deliver games to people around the world.''"
*'''Employees:''' 185 people
*'''Capital Worth:''' 15.3 Million Yen
*'''Main Clients:''' [https://www.apple.com/ Apple, Inc.], [https://www.google.com/intl/en/about/ Google, Inc.], [https://www.nttdocomo.co.jp/english/ NTT Docomo Corporation] [https://www.softbank.jp/en/ SOFTBANK MOBILE Corp.], [http://www.kddi.com/english/ KDDI CORPORATION]

